00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:00.800 line:100%
These past couple of years,

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.800 line:100%
influencers have been
flocking to Yuanlongli,

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.840 line:100%
especially the 18th floor.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.040 line:100%
Lots of youngsters
sneak in to shoot videos

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.320 line:100%
or do some urban exploration stuff.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:18.760 line:100%
Which means the missing child
came here to film too?

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:23.400 line:100%
Yes.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.720 line:100%
So we need to search this place carefully.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.200 line:100%
Han Zi'ang!

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.080 line:100%
Han Zi'ang!

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.960 line:100%
Your mom wants you home.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.440 line:100%
Never seen this before?

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.880 line:100%
Look at mine. An upgraded version.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.040 line:100%
Safer.

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.960 line:100%
Can your upgrade block the sun as well?

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.640 line:100%
Stop hiding.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.080 line:100%
Your mom wants you back.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:20.960 line:100%
Han Zi'ang!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.520 line:100%
Han Zi'ang.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.040 line:100%
I see you. Come out.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.760 line:100%
BY THE ANCIENT IMMORTAL
ALL EVIL IS QUELLED

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.280 line:100%
What's that?

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.160 line:100%
Customized by Yuanlongli.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.000 line:100%
More effective than police tape.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:58.760 line:100%
Say, do you remember this unit?

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.640 line:100%
That case started here.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.040 line:100%
The black robe. Remember?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:13.880 line:100%
Sir, we should focus on
finding that kid first.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.440 line:100%
Shame. It became a cold case.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.199 line:100%
Nothing to regret.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.000 line:100%
And it's not a cold case.
It was mishandled.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.680 line:100%
Don't talk nonsense.
How was it mishandled?

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:30.920 line:100%
Did you forget?

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:37.720 line:100%
That case was the reason I left Weiyang
and transferred to teach in Beijing.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.760 line:100%
I wasn't cut out to be a detective.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.080 line:100%
Stop talking like that.
Who says you're not?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.560 line:100%
If I say you are, then you are.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.640 line:100%
Sir,

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.320 line:100%
did you bring me here to find the kid?

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.800 line:100%
Or for something else?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.720 line:100%
What else would it be?

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:06.800 line:100%
Come on. Let's check this floor.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:10.280 line:100%
Han Zi'ang!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.080 line:100%
Come out!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:15.880 line:100%
Han Zi'ang!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.200 line:100%
BY THE ANCIENT IMMORTAL
ALL EVIL IS QUELLED

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:31.520 line:100%
-Here he comes.
-He's here.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.160 line:100%
ROUTE 11
TRAIN STATION TO WORKERS' COMMUNITY

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.200 line:100%
We're here.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.560 line:100%
-About the same height, right?
-Right.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.600 line:100%
Put them up where people pass by.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.120 line:100%
Make them clearly visible. Split up.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.280 line:100%
Don't waste any of this.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:52.960 line:100%
There's a reward if anyone finds him.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.040 line:100%
-Got it, Officer He.
-Share these among yourselves.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:04.320 line:100%
<i>Liangfen</i> for sale! Fresh <i>liangfen</i>!

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:09.800 line:100%
BE A CIVILIZED NEIGHBOR
AND BUILD A BETTER COMMUNITY

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.600 line:100%
Hand these out.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.000 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.920 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.640 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:34.160 line:100%
The contact numbers are on there.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.160 line:100%
Call this number.

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.240 line:100%
How about this?

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.720 line:100%
Longhair.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.320 line:100%
-My goodness!
-Good lord!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.520 line:100%
-Run quickly!
-Run!

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:50.120 line:100%
Get back here! Stand still!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.680 line:100%
Longhair! Get back!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.680 line:100%
Get back!

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:07.880 line:100%
Playing big, huh?

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.800 line:100%
Only a quarter of a yuan.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.360 line:100%
Cut it out.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.760 line:100%
Take a look at this.

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.520 line:100%
Do you recognize them?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:22.560 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.440 line:100%
No. I haven't seen them.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:31.080 line:100%
-No.
-We don't know.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.360 line:100%
Alright.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.400 line:100%
In that case, keep an eye out.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:37.600 line:100%
Sure.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:38.760 line:100%
Answer!

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.720 line:100%
Of course.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:46.680 line:100%
We'll take care of it.
Don't worry, Officer He.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:49.720 line:100%
Careful.

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.280 line:100%
Smile.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.760 line:100%
-Make it quick.
-No problem.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.400 line:100%
Please drive safely, Officer He.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.320 line:100%
Take care.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.520 line:100%
KIOSK

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:18.240 line:100%
Page this number. 1276165888.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:20.480 line:100%
"Mr. Jin. Urgent. Call me back
as soon as possible."

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:25.240 line:20%
"Urgent. Call me back
as soon as possible."

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:26.560 line:20%
LIKE GENERAL STORE

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.320 line:100%
Hong Kong, China, has been handed back.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.240 line:100%
BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.920 line:100%
We need to keep up with the times.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.479 line:100%
From now on, everything
runs on a business line.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.599 line:100%
What are our core businesses?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.760 line:100%
-You tell me.
-They are loansharking,

00:08:43.839 --> 00:08:46.720 line:100%
debt collection, hair salons,
and protection fees.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.000 line:100%
Get lost.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:53.280 line:100%
You trained all day,
and that's what you learned?

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.240 line:100%
That's called public management.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.200 line:100%
Public management!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.640 line:100%
Loansharking?

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.760 line:100%
Mr. Jin.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.840 line:100%
Why didn't you return the page?

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.360 line:100%
Something has happened.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.920 line:100%
MAY WEALTH FLOW YOUR WAY

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.960 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.520 line:100%
Manlang was in Yuanlongli yesterday?

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:16.920 line:100%
Yeah. Wolf told me himself last night.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.800 line:100%
I saw two bloodstained clothes in his bag.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.600 line:100%
-No wonder he skipped training.
-Tell me about it.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.120 line:100%
-Wolf is here.
-That rascal!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.520 line:100%
Mr. Jin.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.760 line:100%
Please…

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.560 line:100%
Where have you been?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.280 line:100%
Officer He. No one has seen her.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.200 line:100%
You can teleport now?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.200 line:100%
You were at the snack street just now,

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.080 line:100%
and now you're at Jinsha Market.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:17.080 line:100%
-Came to tip him off?
-Officer He,

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.520 line:100%
he's here for training.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.240 line:100%
We've restructured.

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:24.200 line:100%
We don't break the law anymore.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.320 line:100%
Jin Manshan, do you believe that yourself?

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.480 line:100%
If you don't believe me, ask them.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.080 line:100%
What are our four main sectors?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:38.920 line:100%
-Public management.
-Public management.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:42.200 line:100%
-High-risk finance.
-High-risk finance.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.800 line:100%
-Security services.
-Security services.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:50.520 line:100%
-Beauty and wellness.
-Beauty and wellness.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:06.640 line:100%
Fine.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.800 line:100%
Since you've got people here,
I'll leave this with you.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.200 line:100%
-Ask around for me.
-No problem.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:16.320 line:100%
Where's your brother?

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:18.640 line:100%
Jin Manlang?

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.720 line:100%
He went to buy training materials.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:45.720 line:100%
LOUNGE

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.120 line:100%
REMITTANCE NOTICE, AMOUNT: 12,000 YUAN

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:35.640 line:100%
FOR DRAMATIC EFFECT. DO NOT IMITATE

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.800 line:100%
<i>Yuanlongli</i>

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.040 line:100%
<i>Eighteenth floor</i>

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:45.760 line:100%
<i>Eighteenth floor with 18 pillars</i>

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:50.000 line:100%
<i>Eighteen bodies, 18 heads</i>

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:54.440 line:100%
Kids, who taught you that rhyme?

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.880 line:100%
Whoever tells me gets chocolate.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.880 line:100%
-A classmate!
-An old man!

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:03.280 line:100%
One at a time, please.
Who taught you that?

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:14.040 line:100%
Officer, are you here about
the two people who went missing upstairs?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.960 line:100%
I'm really sorry.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:22.360 line:100%
Should I take you to the hospital?

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:23.800 line:100%
It's fine. No need.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:24.880 line:100%
We're here.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.360 line:100%
Maybe you can come in and wash up.

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:44.040 line:100%
I've got slippers.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.560 line:100%
This towel is new. Never used.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:13.280 line:100%
The bathroom is right behind you.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.840 line:100%
Thank you.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:21.840 line:100%
Wait…

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.360 line:100%
-Thank you.
-It's nothing.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.440 line:100%
I have some gauze here.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.280 line:100%
Want me to help?

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.560 line:100%
Oh… Sure.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.600 line:100%
Hold still.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.080 line:100%
You can keep the slippers.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:13.280 line:100%
By the way, I'm Ran Fangxu.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.800 line:100%
I'm Qiao Suqing.

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.240 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.480 line:100%
Sorry about that.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.000 line:100%
You little brat.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.280 line:100%
You're talking nonsense again.
Watch your mouth.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.760 line:100%
Silly boy! All that
for a piece of chocolate?

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.000 line:100%
Don't hit him.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.120 line:100%
What's going on?

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.880 line:100%
Why did you teach him that rhyme?

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.520 line:100%
I didn't want to.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.280 line:100%
This morning, I picked up
a flyer by the roadside.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:45.920 line:100%
That rhyme was printed on it.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.880 line:100%
It said if you don't pass it on,
there'll be bloodshed.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.120 line:100%
That's nonsense.

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:50.640 line:100%
It's real.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:52.080 line:100%
I'm not making it up.

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.320 line:100%
This morning, right when
I opened the door,

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.880 line:100%
something bad happened.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.040 line:100%
There was someone…

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.000 line:100%
Someone?

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.120 line:100%
No one. I remembered it wrong.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.840 line:100%
Don't be scared.
I'm in charge around here.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.800 line:100%
Stop asking. I can't remember.

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.040 line:100%
HE

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.440 line:100%
Ma'am, if anything
comes back to you, page me.

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:26.480 line:100%
Okay.

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:41.040 line:100%
Officer,

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.320 line:100%
I recognize that person.

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.760 line:100%
He had a bag too.
There was a lot of blood inside.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.600 line:100%
Who was it? Tell me.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:52.040 line:100%
Then I want another chocolate.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.600 line:100%
Rooftop?

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:05.800 line:100%
PATTIA CLUB, THAI MASSAGE

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.840 line:100%
FIRE EXTINGUISHER

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:22.800 line:100%
YUXI CIGARETTE

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:24.480 line:100%
<i>Flip-top Yuxi cigarettes.</i>

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:27.800 line:100%
Mainly for bosses.
Twenty yuan for one packet.

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.600 line:100%
FIRE EXTINGUISHER

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:15.440 line:20%
01: I HAVE KEY INFORMATION
ABOUT THE YUANLONGLI CASE

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:35.880 line:100%
Hello, 126?

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:38.480 line:100%
Please page this number again.

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:41.000 line:100%
8233585.

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:43.560 line:100%
Page it ten times.

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.120 line:100%
Leave a message.

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:49.320 line:100%
"I have key information
about the Yuanlongli case.

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:54.000 line:100%
Come to Number 407, New York Block.

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:55.200 line:100%
As soon as possible."

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:58.880 line:100%
Please page it ten times.

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:00.840 line:100%
Thanks.

00:24:25.080 --> 00:24:27.600 line:100%
01: I HAVE KEY INFORMATION
ABOUT THE YUANLONGLI CASE

00:24:56.080 --> 00:24:57.240 line:100%
Are you okay?

00:25:06.840 --> 00:25:08.120 line:20%
RAN FANGXU'S ID

00:25:10.240 --> 00:25:11.560 line:100%
Don't be nervous.

00:25:11.640 --> 00:25:12.480 line:100%
If you're hurt,

00:25:12.560 --> 00:25:14.640 line:100%
come find me at the criminal department
of the Nanshan Branch.

00:25:14.720 --> 00:25:16.000 line:100%
The name is Ran Fangxu.

00:25:19.600 --> 00:25:20.640 line:100%
I'm really sorry.

00:25:24.760 --> 00:25:25.920 line:100%
Qiao.

00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:27.800 line:100%
Can I borrow your phone?

00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:37.240 line:100%
<i>There's a group fight</i>
<i>at Qingsong Cement Factory.</i>

00:25:37.320 --> 00:25:39.160 line:100%
<i>The whole squad's gone. No one left.</i>

00:25:40.200 --> 00:25:41.280 line:100%
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:25:41.360 --> 00:25:43.040 line:100%
<i>He Yuanhang should be free.</i>

00:25:43.120 --> 00:25:44.640 line:100%
<i>You can try calling him.</i>

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:46.440 line:100%
Alright.

00:25:54.480 --> 00:25:57.640 line:100%
The top two floors were rented
by a big boss a couple of years ago.

00:25:57.720 --> 00:26:00.160 line:100%
He secretly turned
the 18th floor into a club.

00:26:01.400 --> 00:26:04.800 line:100%
Half of the 17th floor was staff dorms.

00:26:04.880 --> 00:26:07.280 line:100%
The other half was rented out.

00:26:07.880 --> 00:26:09.200 line:100%
Earlier this year, there was
a nationwide crackdown on prostitution.

00:26:09.800 --> 00:26:11.920 line:100%
Someone reported the 18th floor,

00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:13.280 line:100%
and it's been shut since.

00:26:13.880 --> 00:26:15.320 line:100%
Then what's with this door?

00:26:15.400 --> 00:26:18.600 line:100%
Before, drunk customers used
to climb out to the rooftop from here.

00:26:18.680 --> 00:26:21.040 line:100%
We were worried about accidents,
so we made it a hidden door.

00:26:21.120 --> 00:26:22.320 line:100%
Why didn't you mention this yesterday?

00:26:22.400 --> 00:26:24.480 line:100%
Those two couldn't have had a key.

00:26:25.000 --> 00:26:26.040 line:100%
It's open.

00:26:58.280 --> 00:26:59.720 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:02.960 line:100%
please don't tell anyone
I brought you to the rooftop.

00:27:03.040 --> 00:27:05.000 line:100%
Up there is Mr. Ge's territory.

00:27:05.080 --> 00:27:06.520 line:100%
I can't afford to cross him.

00:27:06.600 --> 00:27:08.360 line:100%
Does Mr. Ge have a key?

00:27:08.440 --> 00:27:09.600 line:100%
Let me tell you.

00:27:09.680 --> 00:27:12.440 line:100%
That old man is Manager Qian's uncle.

00:27:12.520 --> 00:27:15.840 line:100%
But don't worry. The Qian family
is shrewd and tightfisted.

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:17.760 line:100%
He wouldn't lend out the key.

00:27:18.840 --> 00:27:20.040 line:100%
Alright.

00:27:31.560 --> 00:27:32.760 line:100%
BEIJING TRAVEL

00:27:54.760 --> 00:27:57.080 line:100%
YUXI

00:28:08.480 --> 00:28:10.840 line:20%
RETRIBUTION FOR STEALING CHICKENS

00:28:23.280 --> 00:28:25.080 line:20%
PUBLIC SECURITY

00:28:25.960 --> 00:28:28.160 line:100%
Move it. We've got a homicide.

00:28:28.240 --> 00:28:29.160 line:100%
Stay sharp.

00:28:30.080 --> 00:28:31.760 line:100%
We've searched the 18th floor.

00:28:31.840 --> 00:28:33.560 line:100%
What could we have missed?

00:28:33.640 --> 00:28:35.600 line:100%
Officer Ran is a top graduate of PPSUC.

00:28:35.680 --> 00:28:37.640 line:100%
If he says there's a lead,
there is one for sure.

00:29:12.880 --> 00:29:14.240 line:100%
Something big's going down.

00:29:14.840 --> 00:29:16.720 line:100%
This is where Mr. Ge keeps chickens.

00:29:16.800 --> 00:29:17.800 line:100%
Where are the chickens?

00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:20.520 line:100%
That's exactly the problem.

00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:23.200 line:100%
There's something here.

00:29:25.760 --> 00:29:27.480 line:100%
Officer Qu, over here.

00:29:31.720 --> 00:29:33.200 line:100%
You little rascal.

00:29:34.120 --> 00:29:36.320 line:100%
-I'll beat you to death!
-Don't come closer. I'm a police officer!

00:29:48.320 --> 00:29:50.080 line:100%
Doubao, come in.

00:29:50.160 --> 00:29:52.640 line:100%
What took you so long?

00:29:52.720 --> 00:29:56.160 line:100%
Let go. Let go of my hand.

00:29:56.240 --> 00:29:57.440 line:100%
Come in, Doubao.

00:29:57.520 --> 00:29:58.960 line:100%
Why would I go in?

00:29:59.040 --> 00:30:01.400 line:100%
-Let go.
-I won't!

00:30:01.480 --> 00:30:02.360 line:100%
Get in here.

00:30:02.440 --> 00:30:03.920 line:100%
You killed my chickens!

00:30:04.000 --> 00:30:06.200 line:100%
That's assaulting an officer.
I'm warning you.

00:30:08.840 --> 00:30:09.920 line:100%
Stop!

00:30:10.560 --> 00:30:11.720 line:100%
What took you so long?

00:30:11.800 --> 00:30:13.560 line:100%
I paged you over a dozen times.

00:30:14.640 --> 00:30:16.360 line:100%
Come with me. I'll tell you.

00:30:23.320 --> 00:30:24.320 line:100%
Are you

00:30:24.840 --> 00:30:27.880 line:100%
8233585?

00:30:28.640 --> 00:30:30.240 line:100%
I came to see you.

00:30:30.960 --> 00:30:32.680 line:100%
Good.

00:30:32.760 --> 00:30:33.760 line:100%
I'll be straight with you.

00:30:33.840 --> 00:30:37.320 line:100%
I don't have much to go on.
I only saw it once.

00:30:37.400 --> 00:30:38.560 line:100%
You saw it?

00:30:38.640 --> 00:30:40.120 line:100%
Yeah. I did.

00:30:40.200 --> 00:30:41.320 line:100%
Clear as day.

00:30:41.400 --> 00:30:42.960 line:100%
I saw you too.

00:30:43.040 --> 00:30:44.400 line:100%
Get down!

00:30:44.480 --> 00:30:46.440 line:100%
Get down! Get down now!

00:30:46.520 --> 00:30:50.240 line:100%
Once it's cooked,
it goes straight to the table.

00:30:54.160 --> 00:30:55.000 line:100%
Old man,

00:30:56.040 --> 00:30:57.320 line:100%
I'm here…

00:30:59.680 --> 00:31:01.280 line:100%
Open the door! I'm He Yuanhang.

00:31:08.800 --> 00:31:11.960 line:100%
Sir, I'm here to check the gas.

00:31:12.040 --> 00:31:12.720 line:100%
WEIYANG GAS

00:31:12.800 --> 00:31:15.400 line:100%
Gas inspection? It's inside.

00:31:15.480 --> 00:31:16.680 line:100%
Go check it yourself.

00:31:19.880 --> 00:31:22.040 line:100%
Officer He, you were looking for me?

00:31:22.120 --> 00:31:23.400 line:100%
You paged me, didn't you?

00:31:24.000 --> 00:31:26.280 line:100%
I paged the number
on the missing persons notice.

00:31:26.360 --> 00:31:27.720 line:100%
That's my number.

00:31:27.800 --> 00:31:29.120 line:100%
Who were you talking to just now?

00:31:29.200 --> 00:31:30.800 line:100%
Someone from the gas company.

00:31:30.880 --> 00:31:32.080 line:100%
Gas company?

00:31:39.800 --> 00:31:42.320 line:100%
Officer He! It's me! It's me!

00:31:43.280 --> 00:31:44.120 line:100%
Jin Manlang?

00:31:45.920 --> 00:31:47.320 line:100%
Punk.

00:31:49.320 --> 00:31:51.160 line:100%
Are you here to silence them?

00:31:51.240 --> 00:31:52.360 line:100%
I'm innocent.

00:31:52.440 --> 00:31:53.680 line:100%
I didn't kill anyone.

00:31:53.760 --> 00:31:54.960 line:100%
I didn't mean to cover anything up.

00:31:55.040 --> 00:31:56.480 line:100%
How did you know
I was going to ask about a murder?

00:32:03.080 --> 00:32:03.920 line:100%
Rascal.

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:05.320 line:100%
You screwed this up.

00:32:09.880 --> 00:32:12.520 line:100%
All 18 chickens had their throats slit,

00:32:12.600 --> 00:32:15.160 line:100%
and now you're turning it around,
saying I'm the killer?

00:32:15.760 --> 00:32:16.720 line:100%
Put that down!

00:32:20.640 --> 00:32:22.480 line:100%
Where are the chickens?

00:32:22.560 --> 00:32:24.000 line:100%
Eighteen victims.

00:32:24.080 --> 00:32:25.360 line:100%
All dumped on the rooftop.

00:32:25.440 --> 00:32:27.360 line:100%
You think I could just
stand by and do nothing?

00:32:36.240 --> 00:32:37.520 line:100%
What are you waiting for?

00:32:37.600 --> 00:32:39.640 line:100%
-Secure the evidence now.
-Alright. Move.

00:32:40.520 --> 00:32:41.520 line:100%
Fangxu.

00:32:43.320 --> 00:32:44.160 line:100%
Next time something like this happens,

00:32:44.240 --> 00:32:46.320 line:100%
shouldn't you call in
the criminal department?

00:32:46.920 --> 00:32:48.200 line:100%
-I…
-I'm not blaming you.

00:32:48.880 --> 00:32:51.120 line:100%
It's fine if I made a wasted trip.

00:32:51.640 --> 00:32:53.640 line:100%
I'm just concerned about how others feel.

00:32:53.720 --> 00:32:56.280 line:100%
After all, everyone showed up
because of you, Officer Ran.

00:32:56.360 --> 00:32:57.200 line:100%
Right?

00:33:05.040 --> 00:33:06.520 line:100%
Sorry about that, Officer Qu.

00:33:06.600 --> 00:33:08.240 line:100%
I caused you trouble.

00:33:08.920 --> 00:33:12.520 line:100%
But these bloodstains
were likely a smokescreen.

00:33:12.600 --> 00:33:15.520 line:100%
It's possible the killer used
chicken blood to cover up human blood.

00:33:19.400 --> 00:33:21.320 line:100%
Officer Qu, we're done.

00:33:22.840 --> 00:33:24.320 line:100%
Alright. Wrap it up.

00:33:24.400 --> 00:33:26.280 line:100%
Take him back for a statement.

00:33:39.320 --> 00:33:41.920 line:100%
Officer Ran, let's go.

00:33:43.600 --> 00:33:45.880 line:100%
You go ahead. I'll collect some samples.

00:34:02.600 --> 00:34:04.920 line:100%
Officer He. Take it easy.

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:06.080 line:100%
Easy?

00:34:06.680 --> 00:34:07.800 line:100%
I'm innocent, really.

00:34:07.880 --> 00:34:09.200 line:100%
Get in the car.

00:34:09.280 --> 00:34:10.880 line:100%
Eighteen chickens, you know?

00:34:11.439 --> 00:34:13.560 line:100%
I handpicked each of them
and raised them myself.

00:34:13.640 --> 00:34:15.120 line:100%
Don't try anything silly.

00:34:15.200 --> 00:34:16.920 line:100%
Now they're dead for no reason.

00:34:17.519 --> 00:34:18.600 line:100%
You guys get in first.

00:34:18.680 --> 00:34:20.479 line:100%
You'd better get to the bottom of this.

00:34:21.080 --> 00:34:23.959 line:100%
Otherwise, I'm staying
at the station and not leaving.

00:34:24.039 --> 00:34:24.959 line:100%
Get in.

00:34:27.720 --> 00:34:30.720 line:100%
Qu, this case is perfect for you.

00:34:31.320 --> 00:34:34.800 line:100%
Make sure you dig into it properly
and give Mr. Ge a satisfactory answer.

00:34:35.800 --> 00:34:37.439 line:100%
This case suits you too.

00:34:37.519 --> 00:34:39.479 line:100%
He's in handcuffs? Must be serious.

00:34:40.840 --> 00:34:42.080 line:100%
Looks like your temporary transfer
is getting extended.

00:34:43.320 --> 00:34:44.600 line:100%
Will you even make it back?

00:34:45.720 --> 00:34:48.120 line:100%
Well. You're just jealous.

00:34:48.200 --> 00:34:49.439 line:100%
I'm good at what I do.

00:34:49.519 --> 00:34:51.200 line:100%
I can crack any case in a day,
however tough it is.

00:34:52.680 --> 00:34:53.720 line:100%
Han.

00:34:53.800 --> 00:34:54.640 line:100%
Shouhu.

00:34:54.720 --> 00:34:57.240 line:100%
Clear out my desk in six days.

00:34:57.320 --> 00:34:59.520 line:100%
I'll be back on time,
just like Hong Kong, China.

00:35:00.240 --> 00:35:02.120 line:100%
"Good at what I do"? Even
your own apprentice doesn't trust you.

00:35:03.080 --> 00:35:05.480 line:100%
He called me when something happened.

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:18.720 line:20%
POLICE BY THE PEOPLE
FOR THE PEOPLE

00:35:21.200 --> 00:35:22.280 line:100%
FORENSIC EVIDENCE INTAKE

00:35:22.360 --> 00:35:23.200 line:100%
Sign here.

00:35:23.280 --> 00:35:26.720 line:20%
FORENSIC DEPARTMENT EVIDENCE
TRANSFER FORM, SUBMITTED BY HE YUANHANG

00:35:36.600 --> 00:35:38.600 line:100%
SUBMITTED BY RAN FANGXU

00:35:40.400 --> 00:35:42.520 line:100%
Run the tests as soon as possible.
I'll treat you to a meal later.

00:35:46.760 --> 00:35:50.080 line:100%
I told you. If you dress so elegantly,
you won't catch criminals.

00:35:56.760 --> 00:35:59.800 line:100%
Why are you still standing there?
The suspect's been arrested.

00:35:59.880 --> 00:36:01.320 line:100%
FORENSIC DEPARTMENT

00:36:05.320 --> 00:36:06.480 line:100%
NOTEBOOK

00:36:06.560 --> 00:36:10.240 line:100%
FORENSIC DEPARTMENT
INTERROGATION ROOM

00:36:11.720 --> 00:36:16.920 line:100%
LENIENCY FOR CONFESSION
SEVERITY FOR RESISTANCE

00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:20.400 line:100%
Wolfie, we've known
each other a long time.

00:36:20.480 --> 00:36:22.640 line:100%
I won't need to repeat the rules, right?

00:36:22.720 --> 00:36:24.360 line:100%
No.

00:36:28.240 --> 00:36:29.320 line:20%
Take a look at this.

00:36:29.920 --> 00:36:30.920 line:100%
Start from the beginning.

00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:32.920 line:20%
Who are these two? Where did they go?

00:36:37.760 --> 00:36:38.960 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:36:43.480 --> 00:36:47.480 line:20%
Officer, if you're asking me,
who am I supposed to ask?

00:36:47.560 --> 00:36:48.960 line:100%
I honestly don't know.

00:36:51.440 --> 00:36:53.600 line:100%
Alright. That's enough.

00:36:56.440 --> 00:36:57.600 line:100%
Wrap it up and leave.

00:36:58.520 --> 00:37:01.280 line:100%
Officer He, what are you doing?

00:37:01.360 --> 00:37:03.160 line:100%
Don't be mad.

00:37:03.240 --> 00:37:05.760 line:100%
I'll talk. I'll talk, alright?

00:37:57.480 --> 00:38:00.440 line:100%
Ten thousand in cash upfront.
Another 30,000 after it's done.

00:38:01.080 --> 00:38:03.680 line:100%
The cigarettes are a little extra for you.

00:38:06.920 --> 00:38:08.800 line:100%
You want them laid out or tied up?

00:38:09.640 --> 00:38:11.120 line:100%
I want them gone.
